    {
      "id": "AmitySquare_Text_OkWouldYouLikeToGoForAStrollWithYourPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "In Amity Square, you may go for\n",
        "a stroll with a cute Pokémon.\r",
        "OK? Would you like to go for\n",
        "a stroll with your {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Au Square Paisible, vous pouvez vous\n",
        "promener avec un Pokémon gracieux.\r",
        "Compris? Voulez-vous vous promener\n",
        "avec votre {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AmitySquare_Text_PleaseDoEnjoyYourTimeTogether",
      "en_US": [
        "Please do enjoy your time together,\n",
        "just the two of you! OK?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "S’il vous plaît, profitez bien de votre\n",
        "temps ensemble, vous deux! Compris?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AmitySquare_Text_OhOkThenYouWouldRatherGoForAStrollWithYourPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, OK? Then you would rather go\n",
        "for a stroll with your {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hum? Dans ce cas, voulez-vous vous\n",
        "promener avec votre {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AmitySquare_Text_ISeePleaseComeBack",
      "en_US": [
        "I see. Please come back if you happen\n",
        "to have a change of heart. OK?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je vois. N’hésitez pas à revenir si\n",
        "jamais vous changez d’avis. Compris?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AmitySquare_Text_AreYouFeelingRefreshedPleaseComeAgainOk",
      "en_US": [
        "Are you feeling refreshed?\n",
        "Please come again! OK?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "C’est bon, c’était rafraîchissant?\n",
        "Revenez quand vous voulez! Compris?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AmitySquare_Text_YourPokemonLooksQuitePleasedFollowingYouAround",
      "en_US": [
        "Your {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} looks quite pleased\n",
        "following you around.\r",
        "It really is adorable!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Votre {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} a l’air ravi de\n",
        "vous emboîter le pas.\r",
        "Il est vraiment adorable!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AmitySquare_Text_OkTheOwnerOfAmitySquare",
      "en_US": [
        "OK? The owner of Amity Square?\r",
        "I’m sure the owner is somewhere on\n",
        "the grounds.\r",
        "Seeing Trainers with their Pokémon\n",
        "makes our owner happy."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hum? Le propriétaire du Square Paisible?\r",
        "Je pense qu’il est quelque part\n",
        "dans les environs.\r",
        "Il est toujours ravi de voir des\n",
        "Dresseurs avec les Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AmitySquare_Text_YouMayFindUsefulItemsOnTheGround",
      "en_US": [
        "You may find useful items on the ground.\r",
        "They’re quite small, however.\n",
        "Your Pokémon may find them.\r",
        "You should try talking to your\n",
        "Pokémon every so often. OK?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Vous trouverez peut-être des objets\n",
        "utiles sur le sol.\r",
        "Mais ils sont vraiment minuscules.\n",
        "Votre Pokémon saura les trouver.\r",
        "Vous devriez essayer de parler à votre\n",
        "Pokémon de temps à autre. Compris?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AmitySquare_Text_AreYouEnjoyingYourStroll",
      "en_US": [
        "Are you enjoying your stroll?\r",
        "You should try talking to your\n",
        "Pokémon. It will be happy you did."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Alors, elle vous plaît cette balade?\r",
        "Vous devriez essayer de parler à\n",
        "votre Pokémon. Ça lui fera plaisir."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AmitySquare_Text_ItMakesMeHappySeeingAllTheCutePokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "It makes me happy seeing all the\n",
        "cute Pokémon and their kind\f",
        "Trainers."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Quel bonheur de voir ces \n",
        "Pokémon gracieux, avec\f",
        "leurs Dresseurs aux petits soins."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AmitySquare_Text_YouMaySpendAllTheTimeYouLikeInAmitySquare",
      "en_US": [
        "You may spend all the time you\n",
        "like in Amity Square. OK?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Vous pouvez rester autant que vous\n",
        "voulez au Square Paisible. Compris?"
      ]
