    {
      "id": "AmitySquare_Text_IComeHereWithMyHappinyEverySingleDay",
      "en_US": [
        "I come here with my HAPPINY\n",
        "every single day!\r",
        "I can let it run free without any\n",
        "worries at all."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je viens ici tous les jours avec\n",
        "mon PTIRAVI!\r",
        "Je peux le laisser courir en liberté\n",
        "sans avoir à m’inquiéter."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AmitySquare_Text_HappinyAppearsToBeDrowsy",
      "en_US": "HAPPINY appears to be drowsy.",
      "fr_FR": "PTIRAVI a l’air hébété."
    },
    {
      "id": "AmitySquare_Text_OohIJustCantBelieveIt",
      "en_US": [
        "Ooh, I just can’t believe it!\n",
        "I’m so overjoyed with my PIKACHU!\r",
        "Wherever I go, my PIKACHU follows\n",
        "me without hesitation!\r",
        "Ahaha! It’s just the two of us!\n",
        "Woohoo!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ooh, les mots me manquent!\n",
        "J’aime tellement mon PIKACHU!\r",
        "Où que j’aille, mon PIKACHU\n",
        "me suit sans hésiter!\r",
        "Hahaha! Amis pour la vie!\n",
        "Wouhou!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AmitySquare_Text_PikachuPikkaPika",
      "en_US": "PIKACHU: Pikka pika!",
      "fr_FR": "PIKACHU: Pikka pika!"
    },
    {
      "id": "AmitySquare_Text_YouShouldTalkToYourPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "You should talk to your Pokémon.\n",
        "It can occasionally find things."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tu devrais parler à ton Pokémon. Il\n",
        "peut trouver des objets, par ici."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AmitySquare_Text_ThereIsSomethingShinyInClefairysHands",
      "en_US": [
        "There is something shiny in CLEFAIRY’s\n",
        "hands..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "MELOFEE tient un objet brillant\n",
        "dans ses pattes..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AmitySquare_Text_HelloHowDoYouDoILoveThisPark",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, how do you do!\r",
        "I love this park.\n",
        "It’s why I try to keep it neat and tidy.\r",
        "I don’t mind the cleaning at all.\n",
        "I find all sorts of items doing so.\r",
        "It’s quite fun, even exciting.\n",
        "Oh, I know.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Salut, comment vas-tu?\r",
        "J’adore ce parc.\n",
        "Du coup, je travaille à son entretien.\r",
        "Ça ne me dérange pas du tout de le\n",
        "nettoyer. Au contraire, je trouve\f",
        "plein d’objets.\r",
        "C’est très amusant, excitant même.\n",
        "Oh, j’y pense.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AmitySquare_Text_DoYouKnowTheItemIFoundSome",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you know the item {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}?\n",
        "I found some. Would you like them?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tu connais l’objet {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}?\n",
        "J’en ai trouvé quelques-uns.\f",
        "Ça t’intéresse?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AmitySquare_Text_OhItsNoProblemToMe",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, it’s no problem to me.\n",
        "They’re yours if you want, OK?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Moi, je n’en ai pas besoin.\n",
        "Si tu veux, c’est à toi. OK?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AmitySquare_Text_HahahahPerhapsIllSeeYouAgainTomorrow",
      "en_US": [
        "Hahahah!\n",
        "Perhaps I’ll see you again tomorrow!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ah, ah, ah!\n",
        "On se reverra peut-être demain!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AmitySquare_Text_PlayerReceivedItem",
